   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Changing an appointment",
     "texto": [
      "**Avtale** can mean «appointment» or «agreement», depending on the context. **Flytte avtalen** means moving it to another date or time; **utsette** means postponing it, and **avlyse** means cancelling it.",
      "To ask which time suits: **Hvilket tidspunkt passer deg?** The form **hvilket** is used because **tidspunkt** is neuter (**et tidspunkt**)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Simple conditions",
     "texto": [
      "A sentence with **hvis** («if») introduces a condition: **Hvis jeg kommer senere, sender jeg en melding** («If I arrive later, I'll send a message»). If the condition comes first, the verb of the main clause stays in second position: **sender jeg**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
